casebook c-46cfr-63_15-7-and-63_25-1-boiler-draft v1
source "C-46cfr-63.15-7-and-63.25-1-boiler.txt" dated 2026-10-14 by "drafted by anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 from the manual; not yet approved"
note "UNAPPROVED DRAFT: written by a language model from C-46cfr-63.15-7-and-63.25-1-boiler.txt. Every declaration below cites the sentence"
note "it came from. Check each against the manual, add what the manual does not say, then delete"
note "this note to approve. quorum studio will not build a chip image while it is here."

# manual: "An audible alarm must automatically sound when a flame safety system shutdown occurs."
observe flame_shutdown "a flame safety system shutdown has occurred"

# manual: "For steam boilers, operation of the lower low water cutoff must automatically sound an audible alarm."
observe lower_low_water_cutoff_operated "the lower low water cutoff of a steam boiler has operated"

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
observe small_boiler_cutoff_active "the low water cutoff of a small automatic auxiliary boiler has activated"

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
observe prepurge_done "the prepurge period has been completed"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe start_requested "a start (ignition) of the small auxiliary boiler has been requested"

# manual: "35-50 of this subchapter satisfies the requirements for the audible alarms specified in this section."
observe aux_boiler_trip_alarm_present "the auxiliary boiler trip alarm required by table 1 to § 62.35-50 is provided (periodically unattended machinery space)"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe fuel_valve_open "the fuel oil valve is open"

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
observe ignition_on "ignition has occurred"

# manual: "An audible alarm must automatically sound when a flame safety system shutdown occurs."
claim flame_shutdown_alarm_due "flame safety shutdown requires audible alarm and visible indicator" severity 6 needs flame_shutdown

# manual: "For steam boilers, operation of the lower low water cutoff must automatically sound an audible alarm."
claim low_water_alarm_due "lower low water cutoff operation requires audible alarm and visual indicator" severity 6 needs lower_low_water_cutoff_operated

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers must be equipped with a visual indicator which indicates when the low water cutoff has activated."
claim small_boiler_indication_due "small boiler low water cutoff activation must be visually indicated" severity 5 needs small_boiler_cutoff_active

# manual: "A visual indicator must indicate that the shutdown was caused by low water."
claim low_water_trip "lower low water cutoff operation shuts the boiler down" severity 7 needs lower_low_water_cutoff_operated

# manual: "35-50 of this subchapter satisfies the requirements for the audible alarms specified in this section."
excuse trip_alarm_satisfies_audible "the auxiliary boiler trip alarm satisfies the audible alarm requirements of this section" needs aux_boiler_trip_alarm_present

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
claim fuel_without_ignition "the fuel oil valve is open without ignition having occurred before or at the same time" severity 6 needs fuel_valve_open

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
claim start_too_soon "a start has been requested and the required prepurge has not been completed, so starting now would skip it" severity 5 needs start_requested

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
prepurge_done rebuts start_too_soon

# manual: "35-50 of this subchapter satisfies the requirements for the audible alarms specified in this section."
trip_alarm_satisfies_audible undercuts flame_shutdown_alarm_due low_water_alarm_due

# manual: "Ignition must occur only before or simultaneously with the opening of the fuel oil valve."
ignition_on rebuts fuel_without_ignition

# manual: "A prepurge period of a sufficient duration to ensure at least four changes of air in the combustion chamber and stack, but not less than 15 seconds must be provided."
action hold_start when any start_too_soon

# manual: "A visible indicator must indicate that the shutdown was caused by the flame safety system."
action raise_alarm when any flame_shutdown_alarm_due low_water_alarm_due small_boiler_indication_due

# manual: "Means must be provided to silence the audible alarm."
action keep_running idle

# manual: "A visual indicator must indicate that the shutdown was caused by low water."
action shut_down_boiler safe when any low_water_trip

# manual: "Small automatic auxiliary boilers defined as having heat-input ratings of 400,000 Btu/hr. or less (117 kilowatts or less) must also meet the following requirements."
prefer shut_down_boiler over hold_start over raise_alarm over keep_running
